    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The viral horror classic from itch.io now on Steam!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Man in the Park is a multiple ending 5-minute horror game where you try to make it out of your neighborhood park . . . alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note</strong>: this is a free, very short intro to the series. Game #2 is coming soon, and #3 is in development, both of which expand the story significantly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three possible endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic big-screen jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Micro horror game that can be 100% completed in a single sitting (get all endings in 5 minutes)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The viral horror classic from itch.io now on Steam!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Man in the Park is a multiple ending 5-minute horror game where you try to make it out of your neighborhood park . . . alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note</strong>: this is a free, very short intro to the series. Game #2 is coming soon, and #3 is in development, both of which expand the story significantly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three possible endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic big-screen jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Micro horror game that can be 100% completed in a single sitting (get all endings in 5 minutes)</p></li></ul>",
